| Q4 Provable | NO (current state) — Requires authenticated session + crafted JWT tokens. Cannot prove non-invasively. |
| Q5 Novel | Hypothesis only — No PoC, no confirmation the endpoint accepts JWT body, no evidence of weak algorithm handling |
| Q6 Not always-rejected | YES — JWT alg confusion is a real bug class, not on always-rejected list |
| Q7 Reasonable triager | NO (as-is) — Pure hypothesis with no proof. A triager would reject "this endpoint might be vulnerable" without evidence. |

**Verdict: INVALID**

